    "Shared unone-engine serde_json dependency unconditionally enables raw_value and float_roundtrip; standalone player depends on the same Core crate.",
    "Core regressions compare exact typed/value JSON IEEE bits, including observed ULP failures, subnormal, minimum normal, maximum finite, sign and negative zero.",
    "Runtime regression encodes an actual Luau observation and checks parsed bits plus Core canonical digest.",
    "Web regression invokes actual load/tick/instance-mode FFI at frames zero/one and modes zero/one, checking full world equality, UI/observation bits and canonical digest.",
